<title>YUGOSLAVIA: Yugoslav Aug unemployment 836,104 vs 819,467.</title>
<headline>Yugoslav Aug unemployment 836,104 vs 819,467.</headline>
<dateline>BELGRADE 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> YUGOSLAV UNEMPLOYMENT  Aug 96	   July 96	   Aug 95</p>
<p> number seeking work    836,104	  819,467	   778,521</p>
<p> vacancies		   23,352	   26,855	    22,444</p>
<p> total employed	 2.074 million	2.074 million	  2.104 million</p>
<p>NOTES -- Data do not include private sector. Data cover Federal Republic of Yugoslavia, comprising Serbia and Montenegro.</p>
<p>-- Gordana Filipovic, Belgrade newsroom, +381 11 222 4254</p>
</text>
